<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Sydney Casino looks at NASDAQ listing.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Sydney Casino looks at NASDAQ listing.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sydney Harbour Casino Holdings Ltd told the Australian Stock Exchange on Tuesday that it was looking at the possibility of listing American Depository Receipts on the NASDAQ exchange early next year.</p>
<p>It said the listing would provide U.S. investors with the chance to buy the company's stock in U.S. dollars.</p>
</text>
